<title>CHINA: China Jan-July zinc output up 26.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-July zinc output up 26.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 796,200 tonnes of zinc in the first seven months, up 26.8 percent compared with the same year-ago period, figures made available on Friday said.</p>
<p>China produced 102,200 tonnes of zinc in July alone, down by 16.37 percent compared with June, said the figures from the State Statistical Bureau.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (86) 10-6532-1921; Fax 10-6532-4978</p>
